{"about_the_game":"<i>Sword Slinger</i> is a unique physics-based puzzle game about slaying goblins by controlling a sword with magical behaviors. You'll combine chains of magical behaviors together to create complex and original solutions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330940/extras/6746766fbdf76646857e5383d6af5307.poster.avif?t=1773521330\" width=496 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330940/extras/6746766fbdf76646857e5383d6af5307.webm?t=1773521330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330940/extras/6746766fbdf76646857e5383d6af5307.mp4?t=1773521330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Magic Blocks</strong><br>A magic block consists of a trigger and an action. Triggers and actions influence or control how the sword swings around the level. The goal is to slay all of the goblins by building a solution out of these blocks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330940/extras/fa70f908a1a41ac87ff7c25de3eded63.poster.avif?t=1773521330\" width=496 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330940/extras/fa70f908a1a41ac87ff7c25de3eded63.webm?t=1773521330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330940/extras/fa70f908a1a41ac87ff7c25de3eded63.mp4?t=1773521330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Crafting solutions with these magical behaviors is challenging and engaging. The open-ended nature of each level provides you with total creative freedom to solve the puzzles in your own way.<br><br><strong>Level Ratings</strong><br>A rating i